  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Capacita&#xe7;&#xe3;o, Prepara&#xe7;&#xe3;o e Planejamento - Planejamento e Prepara&#xe7;&#xe3;o</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building, Preparedness, and Planning - Planning and Preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Capacita&#xe7;&#xe3;o, Prepara&#xe7;&#xe3;o e Planeamento - Melhorar a capacidade dos pa&#xed;ses para responder &#xe0; crise humanit&#xe1;ria atrav&#xe9;s de um melhor planeamento e prepara&#xe7;&#xe3;o avan&#xe7;ados (por parte do Governo dos EUA, parceiros internacionais, governos dos pa&#xed;ses anfitri&#xf5;es, ONG e comunidades). Isto poderia incluir apoio a directrizes e pol&#xed;ticas, planos de resposta a cat&#xe1;strofes, planos de coordena&#xe7;&#xe3;o e aten&#xe7;&#xe3;o &#xe0;s restri&#xe7;&#xf5;es que podem limitar a capacidade de responder r&#xe1;pida e eficazmente a emerg&#xea;ncias.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building, Preparedness, and Planning - Improve the ability of countries to respond to humanitarian crisis through better advanced planning &amp; preparedness (by USG, international partners, host country governments, NGOs &amp; communities). This could include support for guidelines and policies, disaster response plans, coordination plans, and attention to the constraints that may limit the ability to respond quickly and effectively to emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
